{"kind": "mod", "id": 2235, "name": "Sharper Tarkov Better Life", "slug": "sharper-tarkov-better-life", "teaser": "A simple and lightweight ReShade preset that improves visibility and enhances the overall look of EFT by making the game sharper without over-sharpening it or making UI elements an eyesore to look at.", "owner_name": "goflockyourself", "downloads": 16612, "favourites": 16, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0", "guid": "com.fexlol.sharpertarkovbetterlife", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-06T20:21:09.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-07-30T20:43:58.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-10-28T21:43:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "*", "latest_version": "1.1.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<h1>Hey! This is <strong>NOT A MOD</strong>. This is a ReShade preset, meaning this is compatible with all versions of SPT/EFT.</h1>\n<p>Drag and drop the contents of the <code>SharperTarkovBetterLife.7z</code> file into your root game folder so that <code>dxgi.dll</code> is in the same directory as <code>EscapeFromTarkov.exe</code>.</p>\n<p>If you wish to uninstall, delete the files that are added by this preset.</p>\n<p>You do not need any mods such as <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/813-amands-s-graphics\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amand’s Graphics</a> to use this preset, However, it is highly recommended. I wouldn’t recommend using any other methods of sharpening such as any present in EFT’s settings and so on. This doesn’t reduce performance unless you are GPU bottlenecked.</p>\n<h3><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/crosire/reshade/tree/v6.5.1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ReShade 6.5.1.2008</a> is PREINSTALLED.